    {
      "text": "もう一度だけ抱きしめて",
      "startMs": 146000,
      "endMs": 150800
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah, ce moment est si court...",
      "startMs": 150800,
      "endMs": 152200
    },
    {
      "text": "C'est l'heure de partir, de se dire adieu...",
      "startMs": 152200,
      "endMs": 153800
    },
    {
      "text": "But I'll never forget the taste of chocomint, in Chiba.",
      "startMs": 153800,
      "endMs": 155200
    },
    {
      "text": "(Forever in my heart)",
      "startMs": 155200,
      "endMs": 156400
    },
    {
      "text": "ふたりの距離がどれだけ離れても",
      "startMs": 156400,
      "endMs": 157600
    },
    {
      "text": "この想いは消えはしないから",
      "startMs": 157600,
      "endMs": 158600
